course: dictionary
lesson: 8635
title: Scurvy: an illness from missing food
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Scurvy is a noun, and it is the name of an illness. You can work out its meaning from the words around it. «Long ago sailors without fresh fruit got sick with scurvy because they lacked vitamin C.» Sick tells you it is an illness, and fresh fruit and lacked vitamin C tell you what caused it.
explain: Look for more clues. «Vitamin C helps wounds heal and keeps gums and skin healthy» suggests that scurvy affects the gums and skin. The lesson tells you that scurvy makes the gums bleed and people feel weak.
explain: Try the swap check. Put your meaning into the sentence: "Long ago sailors without fresh fruit got sick with an illness caused by not getting enough vitamin C." It still makes sense, so your meaning works.
fact: Scurvy is an illness caused by not getting enough vitamin C.
fact: Vitamin C comes from fresh fruit and vegetables.
fact: Scurvy makes the gums bleed and people feel weak.
fact: Sailors on long voyages got scurvy because they had no fresh fruit.
fact: British sailors were given lemon or lime juice to stop scurvy.
exercise: «Cook fought scurvy with fresh food and sauerkraut.» What is scurvy? | A kind of fresh vegetable | *An illness caused by not getting enough vitamin C | A ship that sails on long voyages | A type of fruit juice
exercise: Why were British sailors given lemon or lime juice? | To help them sing on deck | To keep their boats clean | *To stop scurvy | To make them sleepy
exercise: «Guinea pigs get scurvy with sore joints and bleeding gums.» Which of these is a sign of scurvy? | Leafy greens | Guinea pigs | Every day | *Bleeding gums
test: Scurvy is caused by not getting enough of which thing? | *Vitamin C | Protein | Fat | Fibre
test: Which food helps to prevent scurvy? | Sweets | Crisps | Fizzy drinks | *Lemons
exam: Which sentence uses scurvy correctly? | *Sailors who had no fresh fruit could get scurvy | Scurvy is a ship that sails across the sea | I scurvy my bike on Sundays | Scurvy is a fresh vegetable we eat with dinner
